        "original_id": "e6621f54-c637-56d0-903b-0c8f826d4858",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: TVPlayer, Amazon Fire TV, Apple TV, Roku, iTunes\n- Organizations: Sky, Virgin Media, Youtoo America, Rev'n, Untamed Sports TV, Biz Television, Tuff TV, The Auto Channel, The Rural Channel\n- Media: Home, Motorz TV\n- Concepts: live TV streaming, free-to-air channels, video games\n\nFacts:\n- TVPlayer is a live TV streaming service that lets users watch free-to-air channels on desktops, smartphones, tablets, Apple TV 4th Generation, and Amazon Fire TV.\n- Amazon Fire TV allows users to play video games with the included remote, through a mobile app, or with an optional game controller.\n- Home is broadcast 24 hours a day on Sky, Virgin Media, and TVPlayer.\n- Motorz TV is an American television series distributed nationwide on Youtoo America, Rev'n, Untamed Sports TV, Biz Television, Tuff TV, The Auto Channel, and The Rural Channel.\n- Motorz TV is also distributed globally on YouTube, Amazon Fire TV, Roku, and iTunes.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
